Stephen Whitrow has acknowledged Klaus!'s accuracy in explaining the Fermi
Paradox, so I've decided to forward Klaus!'s post to the list.

Steve also mentions his concept of "ticks":

"Billions of objects the size of Jupiter?  Masters of the universe?  It    
     
